DESCRIPTION:Come learn more about the Spring 2027 Duke in LA program. Meet
  faculty director Josh Gibson and explore internship opportunities.\n\nSp
 end your semester in Los Angeles\, where film\, television\, music\, visu
 al art\, and digital media shape global culture. Duke in LA places you at
  the center of the world's most influential creative industries\, offerin
 g a front-row seat to how stories are developed\, financed\, produced\, a
 nd distributed.
