CONTACT;X-BEDEWORK-UID=00f1fcdb-0f068baf-010f-068baf83-00000004:None
CREATED:20251125T171815Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the first of two celebratory evenings as Chamber M
 usic at Duke presents a vibrant showcase featuring 15-20 student ensemble
 s performing repertoire that spans more than 300 years of musical traditi
 on. From intimate duets to expansive octets\, these concerts highlight th
 e extraordinary range\, creativity\, and collaborative spirit that define
  Duke's chamber music program.\n\nChamber Music at Duke is a thriving com
 munity of musicians-from first-year students exploring ensemble playing f
 or the first time to advanced performers studying major works in depth. O
 pen to all instruments and all levels\, the program nurtures artistry thr
 ough shared music-making\, encouraging participants to listen deeply\, co
 mmunicate clearly\, and form strong musical partnerships.\n\nThis first e
 vening's concert offers a rich sampling of works across eras and styles\,
  reflecting the diversity of voices that shape the chamber music canon. W
 hether performed with youthful exuberance or seasoned nuance\, each piece
  showcases the commitment and curiosity of Duke's student musicians.\n\nA
 t a time when the world can feel increasingly divided\, chamber music sta
 nds as a powerful reminder of the value of collaboration\, empathy\, and 
 collective expression. This concert invites listeners into that experienc
 e-celebrating the art of making music together.\n\nFree and open to the p
 ublic. All are welcome.
DURATION:PT2H
DTSTAMP:20251125T171815Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260420T180000
LAST-MODIFIED:20251125T171815Z
LOCATION;X-BEDEWORK-UID=18832edc-1b27e154-011b-281c3073-00000027:East Duke
  201 - Nelson Music Room
