 tlight key programs and outcomes across the Strategic Community Impact Pl
 an (SCIP) focus areas\, and feature voices from Duke and community partne
 rs.\n\nThe town hall will offer an opportunity to hear how these collabor
 ative efforts are advancing shared priorities and to engage in dialogue a
 bout Duke's role in supporting students\, families\, and our employees in
  the region.
